    {
      "doc_type": "Declaration_Document",
      "doc_notes": "This is a Customs Declaration form. NUMBERED FIELD LABELS: The form has numeric labels (1–50) next to each field name — these are FORM FIELD IDENTIFIERS, not data values. Always extract the adjacent cell DATA VALUE, never the label number itself. HEADER TOTALS (key_value_pairs): field 7 (الوزن الصافي / NET WEIGHT) → total_net_weight; field 10 (الوزن القائم / GROSS WEIGHT) → total_gross_weight; field 16 (عدد الطرود / NO. OF PACKAGES, value may start with 'مانفست=') → total_number_of_packages (numeric portion only, strip 'مانفست='). LINE ITEM TABLES: The form contains (1) a tariff/goods table (fields 22–31) with columns: H.S. CODE (22), GOODS DESCRIPTION (23), ORIGIN (24), FOREIGN VALUE (25), CURRENCY TYPE (26), CURRENCY VALUE (27), CIF LOCAL VALUE KWD (28), D. RATE (29), TOTAL DUTY (31); and (2) a weight/packages table (fields 32–37) with columns: PACKAGES QTY (32), TYPE (33), ITEM QTY (34), UNIT (35), NET weight (36), GROSS weight (37). Rows 1–5 in each table are pre-printed blank slots — ONLY extract rows where the H.S. CODE column (field 22) or the GOODS DESCRIPTION column (field 23) contains an actual value. For each such filled row, combine data from BOTH tables (same row number) into ONE line_item object with: hs_code (col 22), goods_description (col 23), origin_country (col 24), foreign_value (col 25), currency_type (col 26), cif_local_value (col 28), duty_rate (col 29), item_duty (col 31), quantity (col 34 ITEM QTY), net_weight (col 36), gross_weight (col 37), number_of_packages (col 32), package_type (col 33). AGENCY TABLE: Field 40 (الجهة / AGENCY) has two numbered sub-columns — extract the value in sub-column 2 as the agency_code (sub-column 2 = the regulatory agency jurisdiction code).",
      "fields": [
        "issuing_authority",
        "declaration_number",
        "declaration_date",
        "declaration_type",
        "port_type",
        "delivery_order_number",
        "importer_or_exporter_name",
        "commercial_registration_number",
        "bill_awb_manifest_number",
        "port_of_loading",
